***REMOVED******REMOVED*** Secrets (Bitwarden vault: `${PROJECT_NAME}`)

13 items in vault (all named `assistant/<kebab-case>`, one credential per item). The `secrets-render.yml` playbook fetches them by name on the workstation. See `ansible/vault.yml` for exact field names. Key items: `assistant/minimax-api-key`, `assistant/hermes-discord-token`, `assistant/tailscale-authkey`.

***REMOVED******REMOVED*** Operations

- Status: `./scripts/deploy.sh status`
